# Play test of The Clockwork City (CIPlay clockwork_city, in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in its recipe ("offset").
# The harbour stack round -45 -50 (15 m; its quay -50..-41 -64.5..-63, its ladders at -41.75 -61.3, the office x -48..-42,
# z -50.5..-41.5); the plaza stack round -3 32 (20 m; the Hall of Hours x -9..3, z 20.5..29.5, its door on the north at
# x -9..-6); the gearworks' platform x 34..46, z 9..33 (12 m; the workshop x 36..45, z 12..18, door west at z 15..18; the
# vault x 36..45, z 26..32, door west at z 29..32; the counterweight at 39.8 9.3); the undercroft x -32.5..-23.5, z 27..33
# (floor 7 m under the sea, door west); the observatory x 17..23, z -16.5..-7.5 (28 m, door south); the clock tower
# x 77..83, z 35.5..44.5 (vault 24 m, clock room 27 m with the balcony on its south side).
island The Clockwork City
offset 0.5882 -0.3322
expect step 0
expect title Setting the Hour
wait 5
expect animals Chicken 3
expect animals Goat 3
expect animals Turtle 2
expect animals Dolphin 2
expect animals Puffer fish 2
at -41.75 -55.5 h=16
zone harbour
expect step 1
read The clockmaker's welcome
expect step 2
walk -41.75 -55.5 to -46.5 -55 to -46.5 -48 h=15.05
open Harbourmaster's box
expect story winder 1
expect step 3
use shuttle1
wait 7
zone plaza
expect step 4
read The city timetable
expect step 5
use gong
expect message Thirty seconds
at -7.5 32.5 h=21
walk -7.5 32.5 to -7.5 28 to 1 22 h=20.05
open First gear's case
expect story gear 1
expect step 6
use hourinside
use shuttle2
wait 7
at 34.8 16.5 h=13
walk 34.8 16.5 to 38 16.5 h=12.05
zone gearworks
kill Rat
expect step 7
use counterweight
expect message RUN
at 35 10 h=13
walk 35 10 to 35 30.5 to 38 30.5 h=12.05
open Second gear's case
expect story gear 2
expect step 8
at -26 31 h=-6
zone undercroft
expect step 9
open Third gear's case
expect story gear 3
expect step 10
at 44 11 h=13.2
use shuttle3
wait 7
walk 20 -18.5 to 18.5 -17.5 to 18.5 -13 h=28.05
zone observatory
expect step 11
kill Screecher
expect step 12
read The thief's diary
expect step 13
open Thief's stash
expect story mainspring 1
expect step 14
use shuttle4
wait 7
zone towerbalcony
expect step 15
at 78.5 39 h=28
zone clockroom
expect step 16
use clockheart
expect story clockkey 1
expect step 17
read The founder's plaque
expect step 18
use handVI
expect message Nothing strikes
use handIII
expect shown awake
wait 4
at 82.4 32.5 h=25
walk 82.4 32.5 to 78.5 33.5 to 78.5 37 to 80 40 h=24.05
zone vault
expect step 19
open The founder's vault
expect done
open Market stall box
open Platform box
open Sunk crate of springs
